[{"name":"mcp__decoder__describe_facets","description":"List the facets available for search (the same facets as the web UI sidebar) and the SPARQL endpoint queried.

codemode tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__decoder__describe_facets(args: { [key: string]: unknown; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__decoder__search_datasets","description":"Search datasets, tools and catalogs in the GeoCodes graph with the facets of the web UI. Returns one page of results with name, description, publisher, keywords, places, dates, spatial coverage and distribution URLs.

codemode tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__decoder__search_datasets(args: {
  // Spatial Filter facet: decimal degrees; west > east crosses the dateline.
  boundingBox?: { east: number; north: number; south: number; west: number; };
  depth?: {
    // upper bound (meters, positive)
    max: number;
    // lower bound (meters, positive)
    min: number;
  };
  // Match whole words (default true). False enables prefix matching.
  exactMatch?: boolean;
  // Include the generated SPARQL in the response.
  includeSparql?: boolean;
  // Return each result's schema:spatialCoverage - place names, the bounds of its point coordinates, and box/polygon/line shape counts (default true; costs one extra query).
  includeSpatialCoverage?: boolean;
  // Keywords facet: schema:keywords values.
  keywords?: Array<string>;
  // Page size (capped by MCP_LIMIT_MAX).
  limit?: number;
  // Page offset.
  offset?: number;
  // Place facet: schema:spatialCoverage/name values.
  places?: Array<string>;
  // Publisher/Repo facet: schema:publisher name or legalName values.
  publishers?: Array<string>;
  // Free-text query, QLever full-text search over the graph. Supports "term1 term2" (AND) and "a or b" (OR groups). Omit to browse without a keyword.
  q?: string;
  // Resource Type facet (default "all").
  resourceType?: "all" | "data" | "tool" | "DataCatalog";
  temporalCoverage?: {
    // lower bound (year)
    from: number;
    // upper bound (year)
    to: number;
  };
  // Variables Measured facet: substring match on PropertyValue names.
  variablesMeasured?: Array<string>;
  yearPublished?: {
    // lower bound (year)
    from: number;
    // upper bound (year)
    to: number;
  };
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__decoder__count_datasets","description":"Total number of matches for a faceted search, without paging through results. Counts distinct datasets when facet filters are active, matching the UI result counts.

